  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)-COOPERHOUSE Cleaning Services and Food Handling Skills Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the arrival of the novel coronavirus, USADF and LSETF collaborated to conduct a Request for Proposals focused on healthcare services, infection control and sanitation, and PPE production. Cooperhouse Hospitality Ltd, through a competitive application process, was chosen to receive grant financing from USADF and LSETF. Cooperhouse Hospitality is proposing to training in Housekeeping/Cleaning and Food Safety Skills for 160 unemployed Lagos State residents.</narrative>
  </description>
